    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L12-ACTIVITY-003",
      "SourceSection": "12.2: A Tangent Ratio",
      "SourceExcerpt": "How are the values of \\(\\tan(\\theta)\\) like the values of \\(\\cos(\\theta)\\) and \\(\\sin(\\theta)\\)? How are they different?",
