      "SourceSection": "12.2: A Tangent Ratio",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Where does the line \\(x=1\\) intersect the line that passes through the origin and the point corresponding to the angle \\(\\theta\\)?",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u06-l12.rich-lesson-v2.json",
